# E8 -- full question + Balanced Softmax + focal loss (see reports/02_experiment_log.md, E8)
# Everything not listed here is identical to the E0 baseline, so the difference is these
# three changes (plus the longer context the full question needs).

# unchanged from E0
--model microsoft/deberta-v3-large
--epochs 8
--batch-size 16
--lr 1e-5
--head-lr 1e-4
--llrd 0.95

# changed: the full journalist question, and room for it
--input full
--max-len 1024
--a-budget 256

# changed: Balanced Softmax with focal loss on top
--loss bal_focal
--focal-gamma 2.0

# operational: 1024-token runs peak at 11.5 GB (measured); refuse to start below 14 GB free
--max-vram-gb 14
--save-model
--push-to-hub
